    "name": "FortressCraft : Phoenix",
    "steam_appid": 1038080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The third iteration of the game that invented the Factory genre is now available. Based on the award-winning FortressCraft :Evolved, FortressCraft :Phoenix takes the over-the-top base building and survival gameplay and cranks it up a hundred times. Build your mining base with literally hundreds of thousands of machines in it, explore an alien landscape, both overground and kilometres deep underground.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Voxel base builder for the next generation. Phoenix builds upon Evolved's successful formula and adds a solid base of state of the art rendering, allowing you to build and visualise your factory base as never before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore from a palette of literally trillions of unique worlds, tailored to the difficulty and challenge you enjoy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also. Trains are in from the start. So. There's that.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The third iteration of the game that invented the Factory genre is now available. Based on the award-winning FortressCraft :Evolved, FortressCraft :Phoenix takes the over-the-top base building and survival gameplay and cranks it up a hundred times. Build your mining base with literally hundreds of thousands of machines in it, explore an alien landscape, both overground and kilometres deep underground.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Voxel base builder for the next generation. Phoenix builds upon Evolved's successful formula and adds a solid base of state of the art rendering, allowing you to build and visualise your factory base as never before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore from a palette of literally trillions of unique worlds, tailored to the difficulty and challenge you enjoy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also. Trains are in from the start. So. There's that.</p>",
    "short_description": "The third iteration of the game that invented the Factory genre, FortressCraft :Phoenix takes the over-the-top base building and survival gameplay and cranks it up a hundred times. Build your mining base with hundreds of thousands of machines in it, explore alien landscape, heading deep underground.",
